  article
    header
      h1
        a(href='../../../2011/was-geschah-mit-dem-bohnenpaar-platypus-theater/') Was geschah mit dem Bohnenpaar?
      time(pubdate) May 27, 2011
    p
      | I made music and sound for a play in German for children aged 4 and up for Platypus Theater. The piece is about two beans who need to learn to sprout so they can survive the winter.
      br
      | Some excerpts from the premiere in May 2011:
    .embed-container
      iframe(src='https://player.vimeo.com/video/57196145' frameborder='0' webkitallowfullscreen mozallowfullscreen allowfullscreen).


    p …and a sound which didn’t make it into the video: Here the wind is blowing the beans, scattering and separating them:
    // [if lt IE 9]><script>document.createElement('audio');</script><![endif]
    audio.wp-audio-shortcode#audio-350-1(preload='none' style='width: 100%;' controls)
      source(type='audio/mpeg' src='../../../wp-content/uploads/2011/05/blown-by-wind.mp3')
      a(href='../../../wp-content/uploads/2011/05/blown-by-wind.mp3') https://leoauri.com/wp-content/uploads/2011/05/blown-by-wind.mp3
  article
    header
      h1
        a(href='../../../2011/gunilla-goettlicher/') Gunilla Göttlicher
      time(pubdate) January 17, 2011
    p
      | Art therapist and vocalist.
      img.alignright(title='nn ll egg cover' src='https://3.bp.blogspot.com/_SMhcXIQJwSg/TNgbHmcZr_I/AAAAAAAAMKc/U-ghnPd4B6o/s320/Auri_Goettlicher+picture-logo.jpg' alt='nn ll egg cover' width='288' height='205')
    p
      | Check out Gunilla’s 
      a(href='http://www.gunillagoettlicher.blogspot.com/') excellent blog
      |  about her work as an art therapist.
    p
      | See the 
      a(href='http://mondblume.leoauri.com/' target='_blank') mondblume site
      |  for information on our collaborative work.
    p
      | Some impressions of our performance on 6/11/2010 at an exhibition of artist 
      a(href='http://www.stefanieschairer.com/' target='_blank') Stefanie Schairer
      | , presenting our interpretations of Hans Arp “Lautmalerei”:
    .embed-container
      iframe(src='https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/YinhPOPPXdw?rel=0' frameborder='0' allowfullscreen).


    .embed-container
      iframe(src='https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/4w1c21h9Rl8?rel=0' frameborder='0' allowfullscreen).


    p
      img.alignright(loading='lazy' title='Gunilla Göttlicher' src='https://2.bp.blogspot.com/_SMhcXIQJwSg/TNgcUWzCEiI/AAAAAAAAMKs/Dk9umZaGfos/s320/10_11_06_ArpsMondblume+029.JPG' alt='Gunilla Göttlicher' width='320' height='240')
      br
      img.alignright.size-full.wp-image-123(loading='lazy' title='Hans Arp performance Göttlicher Auri' src='../../../wp-content/uploads/2011/01/arp-performance-us.jpg' alt='Arp performance bei Stefanie Schairer' width='240' height='180' srcset='../../../wp-content/uploads/2011/01/arp-performance-us.jpg 240w, ../../../wp-content/uploads/2011/01/arp-performance-us-150x112.jpg 150w' sizes='(max-width: 240px) 100vw, 240px')
